<<<<<<< HEAD
    The objective is to plant your garden and set traps
    to protectt it from the pesky kids from across the road wanting to destroy them.


    Use
    the computer inside the house (left click) to buy your plants and traps.


    Use
    your shovel to dig into the ground (left click), turnging the grass into dirt
    for your plants to be planted. Traps can only be placed on grass. You can turn
    dirt back to grass by right clicking the shovel


    Once you''re down gardening
    and setting traps, press the red button on the wall in the house to trigger the
    cut-scene


    Plants are positive points and traps are negative points so use
    them wisely


    Use escape to pause the game and exit the shop

    Number
    keys toggle through your inventory

    Move with W, S, A, D and Space Bar to
    jump'
